2d":false,"text":["我不关心老板的私事，只知道诺娜·伊斯特手上有她的订单，而“刑满释放”不久的我正打算来维也纳找找乐子，就这样而已。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/linzhongxiuqichu_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"52":{"step":[[52,53,""]],"type":1,"name":["塞梅尔维斯","","Semmelweis","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["司辰向诺娜·伊斯特订制了彩蛋？所以你是来帮司辰拿货的？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/linzhongxiuqichu_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"53":{"step":[[53,54,""]],"type":1,"name":["塞梅尔维斯","","Semmelweis","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"610023107","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["难以置信……司辰竟然默许了……我以为她早就禁止你这种人插手任何事务了。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/linzhongxiuqichu_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"54":{"step":[[54,55,""]],"type":1,"name":["狼群","","Pavia","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["这个嘛，我的辞职信还躺在她的抽屉里，而且还会继续躺上一段时间，所以我想干脆这段时间来上个班好了。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/linzhongxiuqichu_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"55":{"step":[[55,56,""]],"type":1,"name":["狼群","","Pavia","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["不过这并不表示我要掺和进你的任务里。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/linzhongxiuqichu_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"56":{"step":[[56,57,""]],"type":1,"name":["塞梅尔维斯","","Semmelweis","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"610023122","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["所以你去过诺娜·伊斯特的家。那撬开抽屉锁的人……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/linzhongxiuqichu_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"57":{"step":[[57,58,""]],"type":1,"name":["狼群","","Pavia","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["嘿，听好了！撬锁这种精细活我向来不干。不管是谁撬了那些该死的锁，都与我无关，知道了吗？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/linzhongxiuqichu_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"58":{"step":[[58,59,""]],"type":1,"name":["狼群","","Pavia","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["我确实去过那里，但没有找到老板的东西。所以就在那里等，看有没有人会给我一个解释，结果只等来了一个身上有焦臭味的女人。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/linzhongxiuqichu_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"59":{"step":[[59,60,""]],"type":1,"name":["塞梅尔维斯","","Semmelweis","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["女人……你有没有看清她的长相？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/linzhongxiuqichu_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"60":{"step":[[60,61,""]],"type":1,"name":["狼群","","Pavia","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["她和你一样，喜欢把自己塞在密不透风的影子里——你管那叫“黑影形态”？算了，我不在乎它到底叫什么。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/linzhongxiuqichu_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"61":{"step":[[61,62,""]],"type":1,"name":["塞梅尔维斯","","Semmelweis","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["竟然是血食怪……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/linzhongxiuqichu_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"62":{"step":[[62,63,""]],"type":1,"name":["狼群","","Pavia","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["真遗憾啊，她连一句像样的招呼都没有打就直接朝我冲过来，于是我……嗯哼，姑且说是想要割开她的喉咙吧。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/linzhongxiuqichu_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"63":{"step":[[63,64,""]],"type":1,"name":["塞梅尔维斯","","Semmelweis","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["你们交手了？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/linzhongxiuqichu_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"64":{"step":[[64,65,""]],"type":1,"name":["狼群","","Pavia","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["我的第一刀没有刺中实体，起初我还以为是我准头不对。不过她很快就露出了破绽，我的第二刀正中她的肩膀。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/linzhongxiuqichu_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"65":{"step":[[65,66,""]],"type":1,"name":["狼群","","Pavia","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["之后她抓起一个黑不溜秋的蛋就要砸我。哈？那种东西能有什么狗屁用途？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/linzhongxiuqichu_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"66":{"step":[[66,67,""]],"type":1,"name":["塞梅尔维斯","","Semmelweis","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["原来如此……血迹就是那样留下来的。她是被你刺伤，然后一路逃进这片树林里……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/linzhongxiuqichu_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"67":{"step":[[67,68,""]],"type":1,"name":["狼群","","Pavia","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["你们身上有相同的味道，所以你鬼鬼祟祟地窜出来的时候，我还以为是她回来报复我呢——尽管那只是微不足道的可悲报复罢了。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/linzhongxiuqichu_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"68":{"step":[[68,69,""]],"type":1,"name":["狼群","","Pavia","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["除此之外，她的脸上也有和你这里一样的伤。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/linzhongxiuqichu_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"69":{"step":[[69,70,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["塞梅尔维斯看见狼群指了指她的脖子，发出咯咯笑声。想到几分钟前那里曾经被他用尖刀近距离抵着，她便收回了想要掩藏不悦神情的打算。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/linzhongxiuqichu_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"70":{"step":[[70,71,""]],"type":1,"name":["塞梅尔维斯","","Semmelweis","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["你认为她从你手底下活下来的概率有多大？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/linzhongxiuqichu_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"71":{"step":[[71,72,""]],"type":1,"name":["狼群","","Pavia","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"6201508","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["活下来？真是一个狗屎问题！你不应该这么问的，这不适合你这双红得渗出血的眼睛。你要知道，我所了解的……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/linzhongxiuqichu_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"72":{"step":[[72,73,""]],"type":1,"name":["狼群","","Pavia","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["……只有死人而已。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/linzhongxiuqichu_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"73":{"step":[[73,74,""]],"type":1,"name":["塞梅尔维斯","","Semmelweis","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["好吧，她还在流血，至少这代表现在她的血还没流干。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/linzhongxiuqichu_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"74":{"step":[[74,75,""]],"type":1,"name":["塞梅尔维斯","","Semmelweis","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["一个受了重伤的血食怪需要吸食血液才能恢复，更何况她没有达成目的，一定还会再度现身，我们可以借此机会逮到她。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/linzhongxiuqichu_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"75":{"step":[[75,76,""]],"type":1,"name":["狼群","","Pavia","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["如果你不想现在被杀的话，就别把我算进去。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/linzhongxiuqichu_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"76":{"step":[[76,77,""]],"type":1,"name":["塞梅尔维斯","","Semmelweis","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["……你还真是一点团队意识都没有啊。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/linzhongxiuqichu_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"77":{"step":[[77,78,""]],"type":1,"name":["狼群","","Pavia","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["团队？我想关于“同事合作”这种事，你应该比我更烦吧。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/linzhongxiuqichu_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"78":{"step":[[78,79,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["塞梅尔维斯不置可否。","","","","","","