se,"text":["不。她们是在一个月前失踪的，那时艺术工会才刚刚启动复活节庆典彩蛋的设计工作。如果她们已经遇害，那么现在根本不会有彩蛋投放到城中。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/linzhongxiuqichu_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"86":{"step":[[86,87,""]],"type":1,"name":["塞梅尔维斯","","Semmelweis","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"610023107","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["这个血食怪绑架彩蛋艺术家，就是为了利用她们制作含有蕈虫脂的彩蛋，然后投放到城市里。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/linzhongxiuqichu_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"87":{"step":[[87,88,""]],"type":1,"name":["塞梅尔维斯","","Semmelweis","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["她把她们囚禁在某个秘密地点，让她们在那里制作彩蛋。而为了监视她们的进度，她的活动范围一定也围绕在那个秘密地点附近。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/linzhongxiuqichu_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"88":{"step":[[88,89,""]],"type":1,"name":["塞梅尔维斯","","Semmelweis","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["但她今天遇到了你，并且知道自己正在被追杀，所以今晚她势必不会再冒险回到那个地方。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/linzhongxiuqichu_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"89":{"step":[[89,90,""]],"type":1,"name":["塞梅尔维斯","","Semmelweis","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["这样的话，继续追踪下去反而会被她牵着鼻子走，而时间拖得越久，人质就越危险。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/linzhongxiuqichu_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"90":{"step":[[90,91,""]],"type":1,"name":["塞梅尔维斯","","Semmelweis","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"610023158","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["该死……必须要尽快弄清楚她的身份，缩小调查范围。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/linzhongxiuqichu_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"91":{"step":[[91,92,""]],"type":1,"name":["狼群","","Pavia","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["哈！既然你现在毫无头绪，那么为何不回到最简单的钱上呢？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/linzhongxiuqichu_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"92":{"step":[[92,