迹，这说明她们互相认识，甚至还有可能是受害者亲自给她开的门。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/linzhongxiuqichu_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"99":{"step":[[99,100,""]],"type":1,"name":["塞梅尔维斯","","Semmelweis","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"610023122","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["她是受害者的同事的可能性非常高。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/linzhongxiuqichu_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"100":{"step":[[100,101,""]],"type":1,"name":["狼群","","Pavia","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["哇噢，很难想象人类会邀请血食怪走进自家的大门。难道那个血食怪还会很礼貌地对同事说“抱歉我有点饿了，请你借我一点血”吗？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/linzhongxiuqichu_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"101":{"step":[[101,102,""]],"type":1,"name":["塞梅尔维斯","","Semmelweis","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["受害者可能并不知道她是血食怪，她只要假借谈工作的名义就能让受害者开门。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/linzhongxiuqichu_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"102":{"step":[[102,103,""]],"type":1,"name":["塞梅尔维斯","","Semmelweis","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"610023156","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["而彩蛋最终被正常投放在城市中，从这点来看，她应该不仅仅是想要受害者的劳动成果而已。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/linzhongxiuqichu_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"103":{"step":[[103,104,""]],"type":1,"name":["塞梅尔维斯","","Semmelweis","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["她还想要保证庆典能够不受影响照常进行，让所有人都能参与到寻找彩蛋的庆典游戏中，让他们得以在最后的游行上一同打开彩蛋。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/linzhongxiuqichu_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"104":{"step":[[104,105,""]],"type":1,"name":["塞梅尔维斯","","Semmelweis","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["到那时，所有处在巡游路线上的人都会受到蕈虫脂粉末的影响而陷入幻觉。这就是她的计划，她想要借此机会戏弄整个维也纳的市民。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/linzhongxiuqichu_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"105":